# Canonical name/email → old name/email mappings
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> [Old Name] <old@email>

# Fix a typo in an author's name (same email)
Jane Doe <jane@example.com> Jan Doe <jane@example.com>

# Consolidate two email addresses for the same person
Alice Smith <alice@example.com> <alice.smith@oldcompany.com>

# Name and email both changed
Bob Johnson <bob@example.com> Robert J <rj@contractor.io>

# Only email changed (keep canonical name)
Carol White <carol@example.com> <carol@legacy-domain.net>

# Team alias mapping
Dev Team <dev@example.com> CI Bot <ci@buildserver.internal>

# Contributor who changed their name
Morgan Lee <morgan@example.com> M. Lee <mlee@example.com>
